msgid "工具栏、菜单与快捷键"
msgstr "Toolbar, menus and shortcuts"

msgid "主窗口顶部的 **Language** 菜单用各语言的本地名称列出选项，选择后立即切换。首次启动和恢复默认设置使用英语。关闭时会保存当前语言，手动保存和加载配置也会保存和恢复这项选择。下图为英文界面。"
msgstr "Na choose a language by its native name for di di native name for di di **As e dey Spanish** Di menu. Di change take effect immediately Di First launch and Reset use English Di choice dey save on exit and for manual configuration snapshots Di screenshot show di English interface"

msgid "![主窗口全貌：顶部菜单与工具栏、中央双视频视图、右侧设置及底部状态栏](../media/input-window.png)"
msgstr "![Di window wit menu and toolbar above two clips, settings wey dey right and status below](../media/input-window.png)"

msgid "主窗口全貌：顶部菜单与工具栏、中央双视频视图、右侧设置及底部状态栏"
msgstr "Di window wit menu and toolbar above two clips, settings wey dey right and status below"

msgid "工具栏从左到右怎么用"
msgstr "Di toolbar from left to right"

msgid "位置或图标"
msgstr "Di Position or icon or icon"

msgid "操作"
msgstr "Action Action Action"

msgid "文件夹 · 输入模式下拉框"
msgstr "For Folder · input mode"

msgid "先选输入模式，再点左侧文件夹。视频输入还需勾选 **Video mode**。四种输入方式的素材要求见[浏览指南](usage.md)。"
msgstr "Di input mode, then click di folder to its left Di Enable **Di video mode** As video dey for videos Dem see di following di e [Di guide wey dey visit guide](usage.md) Di four input type dey dey for di four input type"

msgid "软盘"
msgstr "Di Disk wey dey e don catch"

msgid "按 **Save Settings** 导出。首次使用先指定输出目录。右侧 **Configuration → Save** 用于保存设置。"
msgstr "E dey export using export using export **Di save**. Di output directory first **Di Configuration** Di sidebar store settings snapshot"

msgid "左箭头 · 播放 · 右箭头"
msgstr "Na next · Play"

msgid "单击箭头翻一页。播放沿最近一次翻页方向继续；想倒放时先点左箭头再点播放。再次点播放或按 Esc 可暂停。"
msgstr "One page Di most recent paging direction. For reverse playback, click Previous and then Play Di pause again or press Esc to play"

msgid "环形箭头 ⟳"
msgstr "Di Circular arrow ⟳"

msgid "刷新。一次应用积累的布局、显示、算法和缓存修改。"
msgstr "We Refresh to apply pending layout, display, algorithm and cache edit together."

msgid "数字框 · 滑块 · 末尾数字"
msgstr "Dem dey slider"

msgid "输入页码后按 Enter 精确跳页，或拖动滑块浏览。页码从 1 起，最右数字是总页数。一页可以包含多个来源和多个帧。"
msgstr "E press enter page number and press enter to jump, or drag di slider to browse Di label on di right dey di page count A page fit contain several sources and frame"

msgid "放大镜"
msgstr "As e dey Magnifier"

msgid "切换画框工具，左键拖出矩形。要看放大内容，还需开启 **Layout & Display → Magnifier** 并刷新。"
msgstr "Di Toggle box drawing, then left-drag rectangle Di Enable **Di Magnifier** Di detail dey refresh to display di detail"

msgid "弯箭头 ↷ · 镜像 ⏃"
msgstr "Curved arrow ↷ · mirror"

msgid "先启用工具，再单击目标图。每次点击顺时针旋转 90° 或左右翻转。放大、旋转、镜像三个工具互斥；用完再点已启用的按钮退出。"
msgstr "Di target image. Di click rotate am 90° clockwise or mirror am horizontally Di Magnify, rotate and mirror dey mutually exclusive. Di active tool again to turn am off"

msgid "**旋转和镜像会写文件。** 图像模式会在被点中图像的文件路径写回，编码取自当前保存格式；处理珍贵原图前请先复制。视频模式操作的是已拆出的缓存帧，缓存重新生成后修改可能消失。"
msgstr "**Di Rotate and mirror write to disk** In image mode dem write to di click file path using di current save format. Make copies of valuable original first For video mode di target dey extract frame; regenerating di cache fit replace am"

msgid "File：打开输入和复用来源清单"
msgstr "Na open input and reuse source list"

msgid "菜单项"
msgstr "Dem dey item"

msgid "默认按键与用途"
msgstr "Di Default key and action"

msgid "Open → Sequential / Parallel auto"
msgstr "Di Progressive auto"

msgid "**Ctrl+E** 打开单个来源；**Ctrl+A** 打开并自动发现并行来源。"
msgstr "**E** One source; **A** For di folder wey dey open and discover parallel sources."

msgid "Open → Parallel manual / Image File List"
msgstr "Di image file list"

msgid "**Ctrl+M** 手动选择来源；**Ctrl+F** 打开图像或视频文件清单。"
msgstr "**E dey Ctrl+M** Di source manually; **E dey Ctrl+F** Di image or video file list"

msgid "Select output path"
msgstr "Select output path"

msgid "**Ctrl+O** 选择输出目录。"
msgstr "**E dey Ctrl+O** Di output directory dey select di output directory"

msgid "Save flist / Input flist – Parallel manual"
msgstr "Di Input flist / Input flist – Parallel manual manual"

msgid "手动选好一组图像目录后，**Ctrl+P** 将目录列表写到输出目录的 `input_flist_parallel_manual.txt`；**Ctrl+I** 读回这份目录列表。要逐项打开图片或视频文件，请用 Ctrl+F。"
msgstr "As we select image directories manually, After select image directories manually, before select image directories manually **E dey Ctrl+P** Di directory list to write di directory list to write di directory list `input_flist_parallel_manual.txt` Di output directory dey dey output for di output directory **I dey Ctrl+I** Di list dey reloads wey list For list of individual image or video files"

