msgid "**Ctrl+S** 导出，**Ctrl+R** 应用修改，**Ctrl+H** 收起或恢复顶部工具栏和右侧设置区。"
msgstr "**E dey Ctrl+S** E dey export, **E dey Ctrl+R** For edits and e dey use edits and dem dey use edits and **E dey Ctrl+H** Di toolbar and sidebar dey hide or restore di toolbar and sidebar."

msgid "Pause saving / playback · Cancel saving"
msgstr "Di Pause saving / playback"

msgid "**Esc** 暂停正在播放的视频或图像，也暂停正在进行的批量保存；两者同时进行时会一起暂停。点播放或保存可分别继续。要结束本次保存，选择 **Edit → Cancel saving**。"
msgstr "**Ec Esc Esc** Di pause playback and active batch save, including both when running together Di Resume wey dey resume each wit Play or Save To end di save operation, choose choose choose di save operation, choose choose choose di save operation **Di saving**."

msgid "Up / Down / Left / Right"
msgstr "As / Down / Down / Right / Right"

msgid "**方向键**平移超出窗口的画布；在选框模式中移动选中的框。编辑参数时方向键交给文本框，点回图像区即可恢复画布操作。"
msgstr "**As Arrow key** Di selected box for individual-box mode. She dey editing, arrow key dey navigate text Di image area wey dey restore canvas navigation"

msgid "Delete box"
msgstr "Dem Delete box"

msgid "**Delete** 在 **Select individual box** 模式删除选中的框；关闭该模式时会清除全部框。"
msgstr "**Dem Delete** Di selected box for di selected box for di selected box **Select individual box** E dey mode Di mode off dey clear all box"

msgid "Index table / About"
msgstr "Di Index table / About"

msgid "**F2** 打开索引表；**F1** 打开关于窗口。"
msgstr "**For F2** Di index table; **E1** Di e open about"

msgid "表中列出默认配置。加载过自定义快捷键后，以当前菜单项旁显示的按键为准。"
msgstr "Dis dey di defaults If you load custom shortcut configuration, use di bindings wey deydisplay beside di current menu items."

