msgid "单击画面后，从左到右读状态栏：第一栏是当前模式和运行状态；第二栏是页码、来源内的位置及已选框；第三栏是输入模式、来源路径和视频时间；第四栏是输出目录或保存进度。路径被截断时将鼠标悬停在对应栏；要复制路径，按 **F2**。"
msgstr "For di image, read di status bar from left to right: mode and activity; page, position and selected box; input mode, source path and video time; output folder or save progress Di Hover over di truncated field for di full text Di Press Press **For F2** Di e no dey access path copying"
